{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2019-11-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'DISH HIRES MARC ROUANNE AS CHIEF NETWORK OFFICER', 'text': "DISH NETWORK RECENTLY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HIRED FORMER NOKIA EXECUTIVE MARC ROUANNE AS ITS NEW CHIEF NETWORK OFFICER. THE MOVE, ALONG WITH HIRING FORMER CONNECTIVITY WIRELESS CEO STEPHEN BYE AS CHIEF COMMERCIAL OFFICER, WAS DONE IN AN EFFORT TO BUILD THE COMPANY'S CREDIBILITY AS IT ENTERS THE WIRELESS INDUSTRY."}